ous  silver screen punch and you can make it  for your oscar viewing party as well  first you start off in the blender with  some frozen pink lemonade concentrate  mix in some pineapple juice some ginger  and frozen strawberries blend it until  it's smooth and then it just goes right  in your punch bowl  next add some vodka and this is just  gonna add a little punch to your punch  and we're going to put about a cup of  this in  and now the fun stuff the bubbly moet  chin don champagne  i'm just going to add the whole bottle  of this  that's the way to start a party  okay so pour this right into the bowl  and do this just before your guests  arrive that way it's still nice and  bubbly  and instead of ice to keep this drink  cold we're going to use frozen pineapple  slices i've just taken a pineapple cored  it sliced it into rings and frozen it  and that's going to be our ice  now i ladle it into some glasses  oh this looks so good and it smells good  too  and i'm gonna try some  toast to the oscars  delicious  another great cocktail to serve at your  oscar viewing party is the starlet so  we're gonna start off with some simple  syrup and this is just a mixture of  water and sugar that i've heated until  the sugar all dissolves so just about  half ounce of that and gonna add some  lime juice  and some mint  i love mint and drinks  and now i'm using a muddler but you  could also use a wooden spoon and you  just want to kind of break up the mint  leaves in there and that releases all  their flavor gets all that good minty  taste out of them  okay now add some ice to your cocktail  shaker  and some tequila  i told you this was a fun drink and i'm  using elderflower liqueur this just kind  of has a floral flavor with a hint of  sweetness  and we're just going to give this a good  shake so the ingredients get nice and  cold  okay so i'm going to pour that  into my glass  and then we're going to top it off with  some moet  champagne cocktails are really great way  to make any party go from kind of  ordinary to extraordinary and just the  pop of that cork kind of makes everybody  feel like it's a really special moment  okay  and pour that into the glass just until  it's full  and garnish this with just another sprig  of mint or you could put a lime wheel on  here or if you have star fruit that  would look good as well  and this is just a really nice light  drink it's really delicious cheers to  the oscars  and an oscar party just wouldn't be  complete without some oscar games  download ballots and have your guests  fill them out before the show gets  started then you can shine a spotlight  on the winner with a great gift like  moet's awards season gold bottle or an  official oscars poster  you're all set with food and drinks and  everything you need time for your guests  to arrive for the biggest night in  movies of the year have a fabulous party  cheers
 

